# CWYD-7 — homelab homolog deploy (docs/deploy/homelab.md). Needs the LAN or the tailnet.
# Only what is specific to the homelab lives here. The end-to-end flow (upload, two-source answer,
# insufficient evidence) is `scripts/smoke.sh https://cwyd-homolog.lab.goncalvesmarques.com`;
# to send those requests by hand, set `@web` in documents.http and chat.http to the URL below.

@web = https://cwyd-homolog.lab.goncalvesmarques.com/api

### Readiness through the ingress and the frontend nginx: 200 {"status":"ready","pgvector":"0.8.7"}
GET {{web}}/health/ready

### HTTPS and HSTS: 200 with Strict-Transport-Security (set by ingress-nginx on TLS hosts)
HEAD https://cwyd-homolog.lab.goncalvesmarques.com/
